  "sections": [
    {
      "id": 2022800,
      "startingMessageId": [
        202280000
      ],
      "messages": {
        "202280000": {
          "id": 202280000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}你好，是我，「旁白」。",
          "next": [
            202280001
          ]
        },
        "202280001": {
          "id": 202280001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "想问问平日你喜欢吃什么，可以给我推荐一些吗？",
          "next": [
            202280002
          ]
        },
        "202280002": {
          "id": 202280002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "最好是价格相对亲民的营养食品。",
          "next": [
            202280003,
            202280006,
            202280009
          ]
        },
        "202280003": {
          "id": 202280003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "「健康炒米」无烟无油无添加剂，营养但寡淡",
          "next": [
            202280004
          ]
        },
        "202280004": {
          "id": 202280004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "贝洛伯格红肠，仙舟的鸟串等异地小食可以试试，星际快递次日达~",
          "next": [
            202280005
          ]
        },
        "202280005": {
          "id": 202280005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "但听说不包邮，我会计算一下采购成本，感谢推荐。",
          "next": [
            202280011
          ]
        },
        "202280006": {
          "id": 202280006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "很难推荐…我喜欢吃的好像也没什么营养",
          "next": [
            202280007
          ]
        },
        "202280007": {
          "id": 202280007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "烤串，乱炖，快乐茶，翅堡，蛋糕……",
          "next": [
            202280008
          ]
        },
        "202280008": {
          "id": 202280008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "相比那位不死神探的饮食情况，您这也算一种营养均衡了。",
          "next": [
            202280011
          ]
        },
        "202280009": {
          "id": 202280009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "我以为你只爱香蕉",
          "next": [
            202280010
          ]
        },
        "202280010": {
          "id": 202280010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "不是我吃，是不死途先生。",
          "next": [
            202280011
          ]
        },
        "202280011": {
          "id": 202280011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "真伤脑筋，最近不死途先生顿顿都跟着我吃香蕉，可能是为了省事，或者省钱。",
          "next": [
            202280012
          ]
        },
        "202280012": {
          "id": 202280012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "但如果缺少人类需要的复合营养，他的脑袋只会变得更加笨重。",
          "next": [
            202280013
          ]
        },
        "202280013": {
          "id": 202280013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "数次忘带手机，就是营养不良的临床表现之一。",
          "next": [
            202280014
          ]
        },
        "202280014": {
          "id": 202280014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "所以，我要重新培养他的饮食习惯了。",
          "next": [
            202280015,
            202280016
          ]
        },
        "202280015": {
          "id": 202280015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "怎么培养？我也想健康管理！",
          "next": [
            202280018
          ]
        },
        "202280016": {
          "id": 202280016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "多好的保姆型助手啊！",
          "next": [
            202280017
          ]
        },
        "202280017": {
          "id": 202280017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "以他的散漫程度，我来操办也是预料之内。",
          "next": [
            202280018
          ]
        },
        "202280018": {
          "id": 202280018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "开始几天，我把他的香蕉捣成泥，偷偷加入其他水果。",
          "next": [
            202280019
          ]
        },
        "202280019": {
          "id": 202280019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "效果不错，食欲正常，无明显抵触情绪，无应激反应。",
          "next": [
            202280020
          ]
        },
        "202280020": {
          "id": 202280020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "接下来我打算逐步增加新粮的比例，添入人类喜欢的热食，渐进混合。",
          "next": [
            202280021
          ]
        },
        "202280021": {
          "id": 202280021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "既保护肠胃，也能从味觉上重新唤起他对其他人类食物的兴趣。",
          "next": [
            202280022
          ]
        },
        "202280022": {
          "id": 202280022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "一个疗程最少七天，简称——七天换粮法，非常科学！",
          "next": [
            202280023,
            202280024
          ]
        },
        "202280023": {
          "id": 202280023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "七天换粮法，学习了！",
          "next": [
            202280026
          ]
        },
        "202280024": {
          "id": 202280024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "你倒是比较像他的主人",
          "next": [
            202280025
          ]
        },
        "202280025": {
          "id": 202280025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "我们之间侦探与助手的关系是不会变的。",
          "next": [
            202280026
          ]
        },
        "202280026": {
          "id": 202280026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "我看看，昨天是苹果两颗，蛋一颗，糯米一碗，蕉一勺，盐三罐。",
          "next": [
            202280027
          ]
        },
        "202280027": {
          "id": 202280027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "噢，这个时间他快回来了，我去准备今天的「苹果蕉盐塔」了。",
          "next": [
            202280028
          ]
        },
        "202280028": {
          "id": 202280028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "再见。",
          "next": []
        }
      },
      "participatingContactsIds": [
        1504,
        8001
      ]
    }
  ]
}